{"content_hash": "2f1fa6f91c0cb41e", "version_id": 752, "article_id": 76, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Meta helps Zuckerberg pay a possible new tax", "title_zh": "Meta和扎克伯格达成协议，帮他交新税", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "guardian_tech", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/oct/22/meta-mark-zuckerberg-california-wealth-tax", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1689439518196-f48a24b49fb5?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8bWV0YSUyMHN0cmlrZXMlMjBkZWFsfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTI3OTk4NTF8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Julio Lopez on Unsplash", "author": "Julio Lopez", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@juliolopez?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-holding-up-a-cell-phone-in-front-of-a-sign-ilbjfRwOgzA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(112, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(150, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "ba10886f1e8e"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-24", "word_count": 126, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "Meta has made a deal with its boss, Mark Zuckerberg. The deal will help him pay a possible new tax in California. In return, he will stay in the state.", "lead_zh": "Meta和老板马克·扎克伯格达成了一项协议。这项协议会帮他支付加州可能开征的一项新税。作为交换，他会留在加州。", "preview": "California may soon tax very rich people. Next month, people there will vote on Proposition 40. It is a one-off 5% tax on about 250 billiona", "preview_zh": "加州可能很快要对非常有钱的人征税。下个月，当地民众将就第40号提案投票。这是一次性5%的税，针对约250位亿万富翁。扎克伯格身家2390亿美元。他告诉Meta，他正在考虑搬走。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 740, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 48.275, "size_bytes": 290592, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 155, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 49.175, "size_bytes": 296064, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 155, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/76/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 52.95, "size_bytes": 318672, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 155, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/76/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 45.525, "size_bytes": 274176, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 155, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/76/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/76/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 49.05, "size_bytes": 295200, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 155, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/76/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@dcbf67c/content/data/versions/752.json", "paragraphs": ["California may soon tax very rich people. Next month, people there will vote on Proposition 40. It is a one-off 5% tax on about 250 billionaires. Zuckerberg is worth $239bn. He told Meta he was thinking about moving away.", "Meta will give Zuckerberg new shares. He can sell them to pay a big tax bill. But he must stay in California, or where Meta has its base, for eight years. The new shares will not give him more votes, so he keeps control of the company.", "Many tech billionaires are spending money to fight the tax. Polls show it may not win. Meta also said its revenue rose 26% to $64.6bn. But profits fell 37% to $13bn, because of a $9.9bn charge over child safety cases."], "paragraphs_zh": ["加州可能很快要对非常有钱的人征税。下个月，当地民众将就第40号提案投票。这是一次性5%的税，针对约250位亿万富翁。扎克伯格身家2390亿美元。他告诉Meta，他正在考虑搬走。", "Meta将给扎克伯格新的股票。他可以卖掉这些股票来支付高额税款。但他必须留在加州，或者Meta总部所在地，待满八年。这些新股票不会给他更多投票权，所以他能继续控制公司。", "许多科技亿万富翁正在花钱反对这项税。民调显示它可能无法通过。Meta还表示，其收入增长26%，达到646亿美元。但利润下降37%，至130亿美元，原因是儿童安全案件带来99亿美元的费用。"], "body": "California may soon tax very rich people. Next month, people there will vote on Proposition 40. It is a one-off 5% tax on about 250 billionaires. Zuckerberg is worth $239bn. He told Meta he was thinking about moving away.\n\nMeta will give Zuckerberg new shares. He can sell them to pay a big tax bill. But he must stay in California, or where Meta has its base, for eight years. The new shares will not give him more votes, so he keeps control of the company.\n\nMany tech billionaires are spending money to fight the tax. Polls show it may not win. Meta also said its revenue rose 26% to $64.6bn. But profits fell 37% to $13bn, because of a $9.9bn charge over child safety cases.", "body_zh": "加州可能很快要对非常有钱的人征税。下个月，当地民众将就第40号提案投票。这是一次性5%的税，针对约250位亿万富翁。扎克伯格身家2390亿美元。他告诉Meta，他正在考虑搬走。\n\nMeta将给扎克伯格新的股票。他可以卖掉这些股票来支付高额税款。但他必须留在加州，或者Meta总部所在地，待满八年。这些新股票不会给他更多投票权，所以他能继续控制公司。\n\n许多科技亿万富翁正在花钱反对这项税。民调显示它可能无法通过。Meta还表示，其收入增长26%，达到646亿美元。但利润下降37%，至130亿美元，原因是儿童安全案件带来99亿美元的费用。", "text": "California may soon tax very rich people. Next month, people there will vote on Proposition 40. It is a one-off 5% tax on about 250 billionaires. Zuckerberg is worth $239bn. He told Meta he was thinking about moving away. Meta will give Zuckerberg new shares. He can sell them to pay a big tax bill. But he must stay in California, or where Meta has its base, for eight years. The new shares will not give him more votes, so he keeps control of the company. Many tech billionaires are spending money to fight the tax. Polls show it may not win. Meta also said its revenue rose 26% to $64.6bn. But profits fell 37% to $13bn, because of a $9.9bn charge over child safety cases.", "vocab": [{"word": "deal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "协议", "note": "make a deal 表示“达成协议”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tax", "pos": "noun", "zh": "税", "note": "常与 pay 搭配：pay tax 交税", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "billionaire", "pos": "noun", "zh": "亿万富翁", "note": "billion 是十亿", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "vote", "pos": "verb", "zh": "投票", "note": "vote on 表示“就……投票”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股票；股份", "note": "sell shares 卖股票", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stay", "pos": "verb", "zh": "留下；待着", "note": "stay in 表示“留在某地”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "收入", "note": "公司常用词，指总收入", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "profit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "利润", "note": "与 revenue 相对，指赚到的钱", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T23:57:30.310630", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "California", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.9, "sm": 275, "em": 900, "cs": 0, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "may", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.087, "sm": 900, "em": 1087, "cs": 11, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "soon", "s": 1.087, "e": 1.325, "sm": 1087, "em": 1325, "cs": 15, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "tax", "s": 1.325, "e": 1.688, "sm": 1325, "em": 1687, "cs": 20, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "very", "s": 1.688, "e": 2.025, "sm": 1687, "em": 2024, "cs": 24, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "rich", "s": 2.025, "e": 2.25, "sm": 2025, "em": 2250, "cs": 29, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "people", "s": 2.25, "e": 2.975, "sm": 2250, "em": 2975, "cs": 34, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ".", "s": 2.975, "e": 3.112, "sm": 2975, "em": 3112, "cs": 40, "ce": 41, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "Next", "s": 3.112, "e": 3.425, "sm": 3112, "em": 3425, "cs": 42, "ce": 46, "si": 1}, {"i": 9, "w": "month", "s": 3.425, "e": 3.75, "sm": 3425, "em": 3750, "cs": 47, "ce": 52, "si": 1}, {"i": 10, "w": ",", "s": 3.75, "e": 3.825, "sm": 3750, "em": 3825, "cs": 52, "ce